# env
#
# `.env.production` is intentionally NOT ignored. It holds only public,
# non-secret values (the GTM container ID) that are compiled into the HTML
# anyway, and committing it is what makes a production build reproducible
# on any machine. Never add a secret to it.
.env
.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw evidence: campaign exports must NEVER be committed publicly.
# They contain account IDs, campaign IDs and lead-level data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/private/
/raw-data/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
